alse},"author_association":"NONE","issue_field_values":[],"type":null,"active_lock_reason":null,"sub_issues_summary":{"total":0,"completed":0,"percent_completed":0},"issue_dependencies_summary":{"blocked_by":0,"total_blocked_by":0,"blocking":0,"total_blocking":0},"body":"### Tested versions\n\nv4.5.rc2\n\n### System information\n\nWindows 10, NVDA screen reader v2024.4.2\n\n### Issue description\n\nThe popup/text field for renaming a node in the Scene dock is not accessible to screen readers.\n\nWhen a user selects a node and presses `F2` or `Enter` to rename it, a text field appears. While typing works visually, the screen reader (NVDA) provides no spoken feedback for the characters being typed or for the text field itself. This makes it impossible for visually impaired users to verify their input or use this core feature effectively.\n\nThis appears to be a regression, as this functionality was accessible in version `4.5.dev3`.\n\nFor comparison, the search box in the \"Add Node\" dialog **is** accessible and provides the expected spoken feedback, suggesting this is an issue specific to the Scene dock's rename implementation.\n\n### Steps to reproduce\n\n1. Launch Godot with a screen reader (e.g., NVDA on Windows) running.\n2. Create a new project or open an existing one.\n3. In the **Scene** dock, select any node (e.g., the default root node).\n4. Press `F2` or `Enter` to trigger the rename action.\n5. Attempt to type a new name for the node.\n\n**Expected result:** The screen reader should announce the text field is active and speak each character as it is typed.\n**Actual result:** The text is updated visually in the editor, but the screen reader provides no auditory feedback, making the input \"blind.\"\n\n### Minimal reproduction project (MRP)\n\nThis is an editor accessibility issue and can be reproduced in any project, including a new, empty one. A minimal reproduction project is not required.","closed_by":{"login":"Repiteo","id":17489292,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE3NDg5Mjky","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/17489292?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo","html_url":"https://github.com/Repiteo","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/110417/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"timeline_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/110417/timeline","performed_via_github_app":null,"state_reason":"completed","pinned_comment":null}